{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14821","headline":"和崔侍郎游万固寺 · 卢纶","name":"和崔侍郎游万固寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻说中方高树林，曙华先照啭春禽。\n风云才子冶游思，蒲柳老人惆怅心。\n石路青苔花漫漫，雪檐垂溜玉森森。\n贺君此去君方至，河水东流西日沈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14821.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14821","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}